DIV rebrand and relicensing note:

This is a DIV-rebranded fork of the open-source WebBrain browser extension
(https://github.com/webbrain-one/webbrain). The engine logic is preserved
byte-for-byte; only the visible product name was changed (WebBrain -> DIV).

Upstream WebBrain was distributed under the GNU General Public License
v3.0-or-later, which permits redistribution, modification, and relicensing.
This fork relicenses the code under the MIT License above while retaining the
attribution to Emre Sokullu. The bundled Xapian/libzim WebAssembly runtime and
all third-party components keep their own upstream licenses. The upstream
GPL-3.0-or-later text remains available in the upstream repository for
reference.
